# 中频词汇 List05
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024恋练有词
# 描述: 中频词汇List05核心词汇

{{deposit}}{/dɪˈpɒzɪt/}{存款；沉积物；押金}{A refundable deposit is required upon booking.}}
{{depress}}{/dɪˈpres/}{使沮丧；压下}{The economic slowdown depressed consumer confidence.}}
{{deprive}}{/dɪˈpraɪv/}{剥夺；使丧失}{The policy deprives workers of their basic rights.}}
{{deserve}}{/dɪˈzɜːv/}{值得；应得}{The volunteers deserve our heartfelt gratitude.}}
{{desire}}{/dɪˈzaɪər/}{渴望；欲望}{The desire for self-improvement drives many students.}}
{{detect}}{/dɪˈtekt/}{发现；探测}{The sensor can detect minute changes in pressure.}}
{{device}}{/dɪˈvaɪs/}{装置；设备；策略}{The wearable device monitors heart rate continuously.}}
{{dimension}}{/daɪˈmenʃn/}{维度；方面}{The emotional dimension of the issue was often overlooked.}}
{{diminish}}{/dɪˈmɪnɪʃ/}{减少；缩小}{The power of traditional media has diminished over time.}}
{{diplomatic}}{/ˌdɪpləˈmætɪk/}{外交的；老练的}{Diplomatic efforts helped resolve the territorial dispute.}}
{{disclose}}{/dɪsˈkləʊz/}{揭露；公开}{The company is required to disclose financial information.}}
{{discriminate}}{/dɪˈskrɪmɪneɪt/}{歧视；区分}{It is unlawful to discriminate on the basis of gender.}}
{{disorder}}{/dɪsˈɔːdər/}{混乱；疾病}{The study focuses on anxiety disorders in adolescents.}}
{{display}}{/dɪˈspleɪ/}{展示；显示}{The gallery displays works by contemporary artists.}}
{{dispose}}{/dɪˈspəʊz/}{处理；处置}{Hazardous materials must be disposed of safely.}}
{{distinct}}{/dɪˈstɪŋkt/}{不同的；明显的}{There are three distinct stages in the process.}}
{{diverse}}{/daɪˈvɜːs/}{多样的；不同的}{The team brings diverse perspectives to the project.}}
{{document}}{/ˈdɒkjumənt/}{文件；记录}{The research documented the effects of urbanization.}}
{{dominant}}{/ˈdɒmɪnənt/}{占主导地位的；支配的}{English remains the dominant language of international business.}}
{{donate}}{/dəʊˈneɪt/}{捐赠；捐献}{The foundation donated millions to education initiatives.}}
{{dose}}{/dəʊs/}{剂量；一剂}{A higher dose of the medication may be needed.}}
{{draft}}{/drɑːft/}{草稿；草案}{The first draft of the report is due next week.}}
{{dramatic}}{/drəˈmætɪk/}{戏剧性的；显著的}{The region has seen dramatic improvements in literacy rates.}}
{{durable}}{/ˈdjʊərəbl/}{耐用的；持久的}{The material is lightweight yet highly durable.}}
{{dynamic}}{/daɪˈnæmɪk/}{动态的；有活力的}{The startup has a dynamic and innovative team.}}
{{elaborate}}{/ɪˈlæbərət/}{精心制作的；详细阐述}{The professor elaborated on the theoretical framework.}}
{{election}}{/ɪˈlekʃn/}{选举；当选}{The election results were announced late in the evening.}}
{{elegant}}{/ˈelɪɡənt/}{优雅的；精美的}{The solution was simple yet elegant.}}
{{embrace}}{/ɪmˈbreɪs/}{拥抱；接受}{The organization embraces diversity and inclusion.}}
{{emerge}}{/ɪˈmɜːdʒ/}{出现；浮现}{A new generation of leaders has emerged.}}
